    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the water thing isn't really working, it's still stinging like crazy. if i don't want to go to the hospital, can i at least put some aloe vera or maybe a heavy antibiotic ointment on it right now? i just need to cover it up so it stops hurting and gets some relief.",
